      "date": "2026-05-19T00:27:39.000Z",
      "title": "Heritage Foods' (NSE:HERITGFOOD) Weak Earnings May Only Reveal A Part Of The Whole Picture",
      "body": "The market wasn't impressed with the soft earnings from Heritage Foods Limited ( NSE:HERITGFOOD ) recently. Our...",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": "https://simplywall.st/stocks/in/food-beverage-tobacco/nse-heritgfood/heritage-foods-shares/news/heritage-foods-nseheritgfood-weak-earnings-may-only-reveal-a",
